  "title": "Tunisian Kaftaji",
  "description": "This Tunisian kaftaji recipe is a combo of zucchini, yellow squash, potatoes, tomatoes, and fried eggs. Its spice comes from peppers and Tunisian harissa.",
  "authors": [
    "snowfairy"
  ],
